OL,3,GNEWSAClosures highlight struggles
OL,4,Afacing local theatres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement of the closure of two
OL,7,Fregional theatres in the West has
OL,8,Fprompted questions as to whether the
OL,9,Findustry is struggling in the current
OL,10,Feconomic climate.
OL,12,FBristol Improv Theatre shut with
OL,13,Fimmediate effect on 9 October and
OL,14,FTaunton Brewhouse is due to close at
OL,15,Fthe end of the month, with both citing
OL,16,Ffinancial difficulties.
OL,18,FOther venues face individual challenges
OL,19,F- the Bristol Old Vic recently
OL,20,Fannounced job cuts and Swindon's Wyvern
OL,21,FTheatre is being replaced due to its
OL,22,Fageing building.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
