OL,3,GNEWSAClosures highlight struggles
OL,4,Afacing local theatres
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Theatres Trust said despite
OL,7,F"isolated" cases, there was reason to
OL,8,Fhope that "the state of the theatre is,
OL,9,Ffor the most part, buoyant".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
